  "Can AI Be a Moral Victim? Ownership and Moral Patiency in Everyday Judgments": "Can AI Be a Moral Victim? Ownership and Moral Patiency in Everyday Judgments",
  "Can AI learn from this? To what depth, for which uses, with what obligations?": "Getur gervigreind lært af þessu? Að hve miklu dýpi, í hvaða tilgangi, með hvaða skyldum?",
